  "description": "<p>This personalized Christian welcome mat offers a unique way to greet guests with uplifting messages and faith-filled designs. It serves as a warm and spiritually enriching entryway to any home, blending thoughtful design with everyday functionality. The doormat is designed to reflect Christian values and adds a personal touch to your decor.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features uplifting Christian messages and faith-filled designs.</li>\n<li>Customizable with personalized text.</li>\n<li>Offers a soft feel for bare feet.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing for stability.</li>\n<li>Suitable for both indoor and outdoor use.</li>\n<li>Helps dry wet feet and trap dirt, dust, and grime.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Multiple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>customized prayer mat with name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Christian, Jesus, Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft touching on bare feet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Do not bleach, air dry</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Machine Wash; Hose or sponge clean with water and mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is ideal for placement at your front door to welcome guests or in various rooms such as the bedroom, bathroom, or living room. Its design and features make it suitable for both indoor and outdoor settings, adding a blessed vibe and personal touch to your home.</p>",
